  "title": "CGI commits $100,000 to advance surgical care in Manitoba",
  "summary": "CGI (TSX: GIB.A) (NYSE: GIB), one of the largest independent IT and business consulting services firms in the world, today announced a $100,000 philanthropic contribution to support the Health Sciences Centre (HSC) Foundation’s Operation Excellence campaign. CGI is teaming up with Manitoba business leader Chuck Loewen, whose matching contribution brings total support to $200,000. The campaign is focused on eliminating surgical waitlists and expanding access to innovative, high-quality surgical care for patients across Manitoba.",
